    "body": "Isn't the purpose of this to implement minimum interval latching?  See step 7 of the section you linked:\n\n\"If nesting level is greater than 5, and timeout is less than 4, then increase timeout to 4.\"\n\nBasically to prevent:\n\n```\nfunction foobar() {\n  setTimeout(foobar, 0);\n}\nfoobar();\n```\n",
