    "updated_at": "2016-05-20T05:01:47Z",
    "body": "As written, both nested setTimeout and setInterval have the unusual behaviour of overflowing the nesting level at some point unless interrupted. That was what I found confusing, especially because the nesting level is treated as a threshold and its actual value doesn't matter at any other time.\n",
