    "body": "Maybe browsers don't match the spec here...\n\nhttp://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/4222\n\nBoth Gecko and Chrome don't clamp when the nested `setTimeout` starts. But Safari seems to do that.\n\nNow with 0 interval for the outer `setInterval`:\nhttp://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/4223\n\nHere Chrome suddenly clamps the `setTimeout`.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
