    "created_at": "2016-05-20T14:33:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-20T14:33:40Z",
    "body": "Right, it seems likely that this is one of the cases where the spec is trying to make the best of a non-interoperable situation. So I'm not sure the spec's normative content should change. I'm curious how @jdm thinks clarity could be improved, however.\n",
